{"w":2400,"h":2857,"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.20137200673421229,"x":0.71590460411935886,"t":"Sample Writing answers","y":0.050779404074835388,"h":0.021955433385700829},{"y":0.10029069739250362,"t":"This response could be improved by including an overview that covers both charts","w":0.67820068359374996,"c":1,"h":0.01744186102384615,"x":0.23529412177229878},{"h":0.020462756226995449,"y":0.11616515015394224,"w":0.6557093302408854,"x":0.23529412426104518,"c":1,"t":"(so, including theiLibrary user satisfaction' table,) and eliminating the irrelevant"},{"y":0.13591280018969465,"x":0.2352369184588475,"h":0.020827422866127265,"c":1,"t":"content. A wider range of vocabulary and grammatical structure would also help","w":0.66276240030924471},{"c":1,"t":"improve the score.","h":0.016158234080373979,"x":0.2318339084109213,"y":0.15535339373362789,"w":0.15916955312093098},{"c":1,"y":0.18159552123884737,"x":0.19550172852834655,"w":0.15916955312093098,"t":"Example overview","h":0.017532386005633782},{"w":0.65916956583658848,"h":0.018906537263521983,"c":1,"t":"Overall, the survey of library users at this university shows that full time students","x":0.23702421329688947,"y":0.20783764874259503},{"x":0.23529411288320962,"y":0.22673198020109708,"t":"were by far the largest user group, with Academic staff in a minority. We also see","w":0.66782007853190106,"h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1},{"h":0.020388505106793242,"y":0.24273255827749252,"c":1,"x":0.23529411308881532,"t":"that library users were 'very satisfied' the majority of the time, and were especially","w":0.67647059122721354},{"y":0.26308139506580797,"w":0.67301035563151046,"t":"pleased with the helpfulness of staff but least satisfied with the wi-fi and access to","h":0.017534420154910579,"c":1,"x":0.2352941300056951},{"x":0.23167636983832041,"h":0.015745492645541259,"w":0.076439647674560518,"t":"journals.","y":0.28282492807823634,"c":1},{"x":0.8788927341186773,"w":0.032871971130371103,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"y":0.95348837215772475,"t":"137"}]}